## SywContentLogic
syw-content-not-found =
    OpenSYW needs the art, sounds and maps of the original Seven Years War (1997). Click Browse and choose the folder of your copy of the game (the one holding syw.exe).
syw-content-found =
    Found your copy of Seven Years War. Click Install to convert its art, sounds and maps for OpenSYW (it takes a few seconds).
syw-content-installed =
    The game files are installed. To convert them again, for example from another copy, choose its folder with Browse and click Install Again.
syw-content-installing = Converting the game files...
syw-content-failed = The conversion did not succeed.
syw-content-converting = { $stage }
syw-content-not-game-folder = { $folder } is not a Seven Years War folder (syw.exe, FNT1, fst and Ani are missing).
syw-content-browse-title = Choose your Seven Years War folder (the one holding syw.exe)
